<p>You imbue a part of your own mind into a body without actually taking its form.</p><p>The body will work as your minion for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 16, 19, 23, 25</acronym> turns.</p><p>Psionic minions can not heal in any way.</p><p>When the effect ends the body is permanently lost.</p>